## Agregar Historial 

POST http://localhost:5454/historial HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "antecedentes_medicos":"antecedente 1234",
   
    "alergias":"alergico",

    "observaciones_generales":"gggggggg",
    
    "paciente_id_paciente":1
}



### Entregar Historial
GET  http://localhost:5454/historial HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json


### Obtener historial segun id 
GET  http://localhost:5454/historial/1 HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json


### Actualizar historial 
PUT http://localhost:5454/historial/1 HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "id_historial_clinico":1,

    "antecedentes_medicos":"antecedente 1234",
   
    "alergias":"alergico",

    "observaciones_generales":"esta un poco loco",
    
    "paciente_id_paciente":1
}

### Eliminar historial
DELETE http://localhost:5454/historial/1 HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json